Package: nasmv
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: awesomeshot5051 englandtechnologies@gmail.com
Depends: bash, rsync
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Description: Fast move or copy of files to a file server
 nasmv moves (or copies) files to a file server using rsync, tuned for a
 gigabit LAN. The source is deleted only after each file is confirmed
 transferred.
